category: Net
build-depends: cygport libcares-devel libiconv-devel libicu-devel libnghttp2-devel libssl-devel libtpl-devel php zlib-devel
sdesc: "Multiplexing web client supporting HTTP/2 and WHATWG URL compliant parser written in C (utilities)"
ldesc: "Minicrawler parses URLs, executes HTTP (HTTP/2) requests while handling
cookies, network connection management and SSL/TLS protocols. By default it
follows redirect locations and returns a full response, final URL, parsed
cookied and more. It is designed to handle many request in parallel in a
single thread. It multiplexes connections, running the read/write
communication asynchronously."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/testomato/minicrawler
